/E (Our programmes are designed to equip students with the knowledge, competencies, and skills required to succeed in an increasingly dynamic and evolving business environment. The two-year MBA programme is designed to develop students' managerial, leadership, and decision-making capabilities and prepare them for diverse professional opportunities. The three-year Bachelor of Business Administration \(BBA\) programme provides a strong foundation in core management concepts and practices. For those interested in pursuing advanced research, the PhD programme provides an opportunity to undertake rigorous and contemporary research in the field of management.)
